(footprint "BY25Q64ES-LGA8-2x3" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "BOYAMICRO BY25Q64ESCIG(R) / LCSC C50176394. 8-pad LGA8 2x3 mm serial flash. Land pattern derived from datasheet Rev 2.6 section 9.5 nominals: D 2.00, E 3.00, pitch e 0.50 BSC, span Nd 1.50 BSC, pad b 0.25 x L 0.45. Signal lands are b wide by L+0.15 mm, the 0.15 mm being an outward toe extension - LGA has no side-wettable flank, so without it there is no inspectable fillet. Pin order follows the section 9.5 Top View: 4,3,2,1 left-to-right along the top edge, 5,6,7,8 left-to-right along the bottom, which is rotated 90 degrees relative to the superseded DFN_XGIQ TR_WIN footprint. Pad 9 is the exposed pad, which the datasheet Note 1 states is FLOATING inside the package - the land is deliberately undersized (1.50 x 1.00) because section 9.5 does not dimension its height unambiguously; tying it to GND is harmless since there is no internal connection.")
  (tags "flash SPI LGA8 2x3 BOYAMICRO BY25Q64")
